    A never-fired cron is NOT automatically a fault: a monthly cron added
    after its day-of-month, or a workflow added today, has legitimately not
    reached a slot. The cron and the age are printed so that is decidable
    here rather than inferred from a count. NEVER_FIRED_GRACE_DAYS=40.

